{"id":"en_oil-empire","title":"Oil Empire","titleEn":"Oil Empire","description":"Caleb grandit dans une misère extrême à Olive Creek, petite bourgade isolée du Texas. Devenu orphelin très tôt, il habite seul une caravane délabrée, subissant les moqueries de ses voisins et l'exploitation de sa propre famille, tandis que même l'épicier lui refuse tout crédit. De tout son héritage ne reste qu'une immense parcelle aride que tout le monde surnomme « la décharge oubliée de Dieu ». La série peut être suivie sur Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/oil-empire/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/oil-empire/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Country","Male","Small Town","Tear-Jerker","Tragedy","Underdog Rise"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2x2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_oil-empire_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2x2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_oil-empire_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2x2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_oil-empire_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2x2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_oil-empire_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt2x2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_oil-empire_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v